    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "State Legislative Assemblies do NOT participate in the Vice President's election, unlike the President's election.",
        "Nominated members of Parliament vote in the Vice President's election, whereas they cannot vote in the President's election.",
        "A removal resolution against the Vice President can ONLY originate in the Rajya Sabha."
